    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Venus,Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1</p><p>Enhanced versions of peregrine falcons and other predatory birds are common in large, open habitats, and the hobby of falconry has made a comeback. Some smart falcons have been trained for surveillance or security purposes, tracking or finding subjects from overhead.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Claws, Enhanced Hearing, Enhanced Vision</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 3, Death Rating 23.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 160.</em></p>",
